XTRATA / AUDIONALS — X SEARCH TERMS
One query per line. Paste straight into X search.
Always click the Latest tab, or add &f=live to the URL.

--- 1. SOMEONE HAS THE PROBLEM YOU FIXED (highest value) ---

("IPFS" OR "pinata" OR "arweave") (broken OR dead OR "not loading" OR unpinned) NFT
NFT ("metadata is gone" OR "image is gone" OR "link is dead" OR "404")
("shut down" OR "rugged" OR "servers are down") (NFT OR collection) art

--- 2. CATEGORY CONVERSATIONS ---

"fully on-chain" -"fully on-chain gaming"
"recursive inscriptions"
"on-chain music" OR "music on Bitcoin" OR "on-chain audio"
ordinals (permanence OR storage OR "off-chain" OR immutable)

--- 3. BUILDER CHATTER WHERE YOU HAVE DONE THE WORK ---

("passkey wallet" OR "seedless wallet" OR "embedded wallet") crypto
("gasless" OR "sponsored transaction" OR "pays the gas") (Stacks OR Bitcoin)
(sBTC OR "Stacks") (building OR shipped OR launch) -airdrop -giveaway

--- 4. AUDIONALS NARROW TERMS (low volume, always worth a reply) ---

BVST OR "Bitcoin VST"
Audionals

--- 5. LIVE SPACES AND STREAMS ---

filter:spaces (Stacks OR ordinals OR "on-chain music")
("Space" OR "Spaces") (Stacks OR ordinals OR sBTC OR "web3 music") (today OR tonight OR "going live" OR "joining us")
url:i/spaces (bitcoin OR music OR inscriptions)
filter:native_video (ordinals OR Stacks OR "on-chain music")

--- FILTERS TO ADD TO ANY LINE ABOVE ---

within_time:1d          last 24 hours
within_time:2h          last 2 hours
since:2026-08-10 until:2026-08-17    date range, YYYY-MM-DD
min_faves:5             only posts with some traction
-filter:replies         top-level posts only
-filter:links           discussion rather than promo
lang:en

--- EXAMPLE WITH FILTERS APPLIED ---

("fully on-chain" OR "recursive inscriptions") -filter:replies min_faves:3 within_time:1d lang:en

--- NOTES ---

X operator support is inconsistent and changes without notice.
filter:spaces and url: have both been unreliable at times. Try each once and
keep the ones that behave.

Sorting matters more than the query. X defaults to Top, which is engagement
ranked and buries anything from the last hour. Latest is the tab you want.
